# Revert of libplacebo commit 3c3bf6e7 ("dispatch: reject rendering to UINT/SINT formats")
#
# WHY: 3c3bf6e fires PL_ERR_INVALID_FORMAT when mpv's gpu-next + MoltenVK
# on macOS submits certain pass configurations (e.g. DV FEL BL/EL merge
# intermediate render targets). libplacebo's caller doesn't handle this error,
# leaving a dangling VkCommandBuffer → SIGSEGV in pl_pass_create.
#
# WHAT WE KEEP: All 13 other commits in the 41ac2980..HEAD window, which give us:
#   - vulkan semaphore fixes (b9484d2, de357dc, 3330a51, 2ba21c0) → 收益#8 消帧撕裂
#   - highest depth format (6111164)                              → 收益#10 DV精度
#   - clip output signal range (e2972fd)                          → 收益#9 cropdetect精度
#   - plus colorspace/shaders/renderer cleanups
#
# FUTURE: When libplacebo upstream fixes 3c3bf6e (or mpv learns to handle
# PL_ERR_INVALID_FORMAT), delete this patch and unpin to master.

commit 3c3bf6e7a79b6d76340f596185a4715dff4eca4f
Author: Niklas Haas <git@haasn.dev>
Date:   Wed Aug 26 16:47:40 2026 +0200

    dispatch: reject rendering to UINT/SINT formats
    
    This would require changes to the output color signature, as well as the
    renderer.
    
    Sponsored-by: nxtedition AB
    Signed-off-by: Niklas Haas <git@haasn.dev>

